title: "LiverSegMRI"
abstract: >-
  Sequence-agnostic whole-liver segmentation on abdominal MRI: a five-fold nnU-Net v2 ensemble with the code used
  to run the comparator models, the evaluation metrics and the statistical analysis of the study.
